# === IDE and Editor ===
.vs/
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# === Local Tooling (per-machine paths / proxy configs / launcher scripts) ===
# Never commit scripts containing local absolute paths, proxy IPs, or env-specific config.
*.bat
*.cmd
*.ps1.local

# === Asset Source Packs (kept locally, only curated files copied into assets/) ===
# Ark Pixel font full-language pack is 158 MB — only 2 TTFs are actually used (in assets/font/).
/font/

# === Godot Plugins / Addons (installed via AssetLib by each developer) ===
# GUT (Godot Unit Test) is installed locally via AssetLib to keep third-party
# code out of git history. New devs: re-install via Project → AssetLib → search "Gut".
/addons/gut/

# === Malformed / Quarantine ===
# Catch any future `cp ... "path"` accidents whose target name contains a stray quote.
assets/font" *
**/* && cp *

# === Claude Code Local ===
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/docs/UPGRADE-PLAN.md
CLAUDE.local.md
production/session-logs/
production/session-state/*.md

# === Internal Planning (not for public) ===
docs/IMPROVEMENTS-PROPOSAL.md
docs/MULTI-STAGE-DOCUMENT-WORKFLOW.md

